OL,4,G2300FSHERELLE
OL,5,     GThe first of two Saturday night
OL,6,     Gshows rounding up some of
OL,7,     GSHERELLE's favourite 2025 tracks!
OL,8,     GFeaturing music from Brighter
OL,9,     GDays Family, keiyaA, Ayesha and
OL,10,     Gmore.
OL,11,G0030FThe Sweatbox
OL,12,     GThe multi-faceted London producer
OL,13,     Gbrings his signature energy to
OL,14,     Gthe Sweatbox, with a healthy dose
OL,15,     Gof his own edits and releases.
OL,16,G0100F6 Music's Rave Forever
OL,17,     GA sonic journey through the
OL,18,     Gsignature remixes of legendary
OL,19,     Gduo Deep Dish. From underground
OL,20,     Ganthems to remixes of chart-
OL,21,     Gtopping pop, their catalogue
OL,22,     Gdeserves a whole show's focus.
